# Spec for tools/riscpkg.py: Geany.
Package: Geany
Section: Development
Priority: Optional
Licence: Free
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 0.4.0
Environment: arm32, vfpv3
Depends: SharedUnixLibrary (>= 1.16), ARMEABISupport, Iconv
Recommends: TTF-Noto-Color-Emoji
Components: Apps.Development.!Geany (Movable LookAt)
Homepage: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-gtk
Description: Geany programmer's editor (GTK 3)
 A fast programmer's editor: syntax highlighting for dozens of
 languages, a symbol list and tabs. Build commands run in a TaskWindow
 with errors listed in the Compiler tab (DDE throwback supported).
 .
 This is a public beta of the riscos-gtk ports.
Build-Map: !Geany -> Apps/Development/!Geany
Build-Notice: Geany, packaged for PackMan from the riscos-gtk release zip on
 https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-gtk/releases
 .
 Geany is Geany 2.1 (www.geany.org), under the GNU GPL version 2. It is linked with GTK 3 and its
 libraries (LGPL) and includes DejaVu fonts and PThreadTicker. The
 source is offered by the Source file in the application and on the
 release page. Licences follow.
